    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[7].m_Arguments.m_BoolArgument
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[0].m_Arguments.m_ObjectArgument
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e37ef6d79031a7c45a5267ce67c9abfe, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[3].m_Arguments.m_StringArgument
      value: 'I often grow tired of all of this talk of me being a witch. Just yesterday,
        I brought some daisies over to the apothecary, when I was being jeered at.
        Honestly, I cannot wait for the trial - it will finally bring some peace
        back to me. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[4].m_Arguments.m_StringArgument
      value: Is it because I am a woman practising healing? I thought we left such
        ideals in the past. At least I know my husband and children support me; their
        help has been a welcome reprieve.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[5].m_Arguments.m_StringArgument
      value: But that woman - Jenneke - I should attempt to speak with her one more
        time. Her ailment is clouding her senses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[6].m_Arguments.m_StringArgument
      value: "I woke up in this woman\u2019s body. It seems that a trial by water
        is about to take place - I should see if I can prove my innocence in a different
        way. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: onInteracted.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.data[1].m_Arguments.m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName
      value: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4497541520896112983, guid: e8d4fcb31affca74c9312ab32f7e08c8, type: 3}
